# missingmed — Missing-data causal mediation (R package, mediationverse)
# Scope decided 2026-06-04 (Data-Wise/missingmed#1): general CRAN-targeted toolkit —
# MI + IPW estimators, SEM + GLM models, MAR + MNAR sensitivity. S7-first.
# Thin orchestration layer: fit via medfit, infer via rmediation, simulate via medsim.

## v0.2.0 RELEASED — 2026-06-12 (all integration steps DONE)
# - main = 0.2.0 (PR #3 ipw-phase1->dev, PR #4 dev->main). GitHub release v0.2.0.
#   https://github.com/Data-Wise/missingmed/releases/tag/v0.2.0
# - medfit 0.3.1 + RMediation 1.4.0 live on r-universe (deps satisfied).
# - Feature worktrees + branches (feature/s7-migration, feature/ipw-phase1) merged
#   and DELETED. Only docs/ipw-phase1-spec remains (historical spec).
# - CI fixes that unblocked the release (key learnings):
#     * RMediation remote MUST be name-qualified: RMediation=data-wise/rmediation
#       (repo 'rmediation' != package 'RMediation'); plain form fails pak solve.
#     * DESCRIPTION Additional_repositories = data-wise r-universe (non-CRAN deps).
#     * check.yml modernized off renv::restore() (stale lock -> old rlang fails to
#       compile on R 4.6) to standard r-lib setup-r-dependencies + check-r-package.
#     * RENV_CONFIG_AUTOLOADER_ENABLED=FALSE in CI (keep dev renv out of CI).
# - pkgdown destination = pkgdown-site (docs/ holds specs); deploy via gh-pages.
# - Post-release watch: r-universe rebuild of missingmed 0.2.0 (cron); main CI/site deploy.

## Quick Notes
- 2026-06-11: Phase 0 S4->S7 migration IMPLEMENTED on feature/s7-migration (pushed,
  up to commit c4eb495; 11 commits, P0.1–P0.8 + 2 follow-ups). NOT yet merged to dev.
  - S7 classes MDMediationData/MDMediationFit/MDMediationResult; pipeline
    set_md_mediation() -> run() -> pool() -> infer(type=c("mc","mbco")).
  - run() delegates each imputation to medfit::fit_mediation() (named a/b/c_prime);
    pool() = Rubin's rules -> NAMED pooled medfit::MediationData (Open Q3 closed);
    per_imputation_list() accessor (#2 closed); D4-stacked MBCO HOSTED in missingmed
    (R/mbco_mi.R) — exact parity with research prototype (max abs diff 4.8e-11, 3 cells).
  - Namespace is RMediation (capital), NOT rmediation. medfit+RMediation in Imports.
  - S4 set_sem/run_sem/pool_sem .Deprecated() shims kept one cycle.
  - R CMD check E0/W0/N0; 47 tests pass; vignettes + _pkgdown.yml + pkgdown deploy wf.
  - Worktree: ~/.git-worktrees/missingmed/feature-s7-migration.
- 2026-06-11: Phase 1 IPW estimator SPEC drafted (cloud routine) on branch
  docs/ipw-phase1-spec — docs/specs/SPEC-ipw-phase1-2026-06-11.md. Design = thin
  run() branch (.ipw_run: estimate weights -> medfit::fit_mediation(weights=) ->
  MDMediationFit(m=1)) + passthrough pool() (B=0).
  - OQ-1 BLOCKER RESOLVED + IMPLEMENTED: medfit feature/fit-weights (pushed) adds
    weights= to fit_mediation() (do.call inlines value; unweighted byte-identical;
    weighted vcov via extract_mediation). medfit 802 tests pass. Worktree:
    ~/.git-worktrees/medfit/feature-fit-weights.
  - Design OQs still open: OQ-2 weight model (joint vs sequential), OQ-3 SE
    (model-based vs sandwich) — decisions for manuscript author.
  - Integration order for IPW impl: needs S7 pipeline (feature/s7-migration) +
    patched medfit (feature/fit-weights). IPW branch based on both.
- 2026-06-11: Phase 1 IPW IMPLEMENTED on feature/ipw-phase1 (off feature/s7-migration,
  pushed). method='ipw' takes a data.frame; run()->.ipw_run (weights: joint default
  + per-variable list, stabilized, trim) -> medfit::fit_mediation(weights=, se_type=
  'sandwich') -> MDMediationFit(m=1); pool() passthrough (B=0); infer('mc') reuses
  ci_mediation_data; infer('mbco') errors for IPW. New props on MDMediationData
  (weight_formula/weight_stabilize/weight_trim/se_type) + data.frame validator;
  MDMediationFit@weights. R CMD check E0/W0/N0; 72 tests. Technical vignette
  (vignettes/technical.Rmd) covers all design/contracts/methodology.
  DEPENDS ON medfit feature/fit-weights (weights= + se_type=sandwich, 806 tests).
  Worktrees: ~/.git-worktrees/missingmed/{feature-s7-migration,feature-ipw-phase1},
  ~/.git-worktrees/medfit/feature-fit-weights.
- Future scope phases = IPW (Phase 1, spec'd/blocked), GLM, MNAR sensitivity.
- Scope spec + 6-phase roadmap: docs/specs/SPEC-missingmed-scope-2026-06-04.md (on dev)
- 2026-06-11: Phase 0 PLAN written — docs/specs/SPEC-s7-migration-phase0-2026-06-11.md
  (S4->S7 class mapping, ordered steps P0.1–P0.7, acceptance). Resolves scope Open Q3
  (pooled MediationData constructor) as step P0.3.
- 2026-06-11: Consumer contract documented — docs/CONTRACT-mbco-mi-handoff-2026-06-11.md.
  The Missing Effect MBCO-MI study (now inference-led; target Psychological Methods) needs:
  (1) pool() -> NAMED medfit::MediationData; (2) per-imputation list accessor (missingmed#2),
  because MBCO does not commute with Rubin's rules (D4-stacked MBCO). NOT a blocker —
  manuscript runs on research/Missing Effect/code/prototype-d4-mbco.R meanwhile.
- Contracts confirmed: rmediation (MBCO/MC-CI, consumes medfit MediationData),
  medfit (fit_mediation/extract_mediation -> MediationData@estimates/@vcov).
- missingmed's unique code = Rubin's-rules pooling of NAMED (estimates, vcov) + IPW weights + MNAR.
- Next: integrate feature/s7-migration, then scope Phase 1 (IPW/GLM/MNAR).
- Branches: main (protected) <- dev (current) <- feature/*. Companion manuscript: research/Missing Effect.
